      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=72><color=#2DE2E6>LOST PACKET</color></size>\r\n<size=32>A signal-hunting
    game menu system</size>\r\n\r\n\r\n<size=44><color=#F3E9FF>DESIGN AND UI</color></size>\r\nRUHMA
    BINTE ASAD \r\nCS464 Game Development, Fall 2026\r\n\r\n\r\n<size=44><color=#F3E9FF>VISUAL
    REFERENCES</color></size>\r\nRetro CRT and VHS interfaces\r\nSecurity-camera
    horror mood (mood only, no assets used)\r\n\r\n\r\n<size=44><color=#F3E9FF>FONTS</color></size>\r\nHandjet
    and Pixelify Sans\r\nGoogle Fonts, SIL Open Font License\r\n\r\n\r\n<size=44><color=#F3E9FF>BUILT
    WITH</color></size>\r\nUnity 6 and TextMeshPro\r\nAll shapes and effects made
    in-engine\r\nNo AI-generated images\r\n\r\n\r\n<size=44><color=#F3E9FF>COURSE
    MATERIAL</color></size>\r\nCS464 Lecture 08: Colour, UI and Menus\r\n\r\n\r\n<size=44><color=#F3E9FF>THANK
    YOU FOR PLAYING</color></size>"
